    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A combination of a transmitter and a receiver, this device allows for wireless communication between machines and networks. It has many potential uses.For example, you can attach it to plastic explosives and detonate them wirelessly. If a machine or network has no wireless capabilities, you can connect a wireless transceiver to a port and use that for wireless connections. The transceiver has a wireless range of up to 1,000 feet.</p>",
